      "description": "Native select with the shared input treatment.",
      "html": "<select class=\"ds-filter\" aria-label=\"Verjaardagen filteren op team\"><option>Alle toegankelijke personen</option><option>Mijn team</option></select>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{font-family:var(--font-sans,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;padding:.5rem 3.25rem .5rem .75rem;border:1px solid var(--color-gray-300,oklch(87.2% .01 258.338));border-radius:.5rem;background:transparent;color:var(--color-gray-900,oklch(21% .034 264.665));box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / .05);max-width:100%}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--color-cyan-300,oklch(86.5% .127 207.078)) 50%,transparent);border-color:var(--color-electric-cyan,oklch(.69 .14 196))}"
